  <text>
    <body>
      <p source="#source-430-459"><seg source="#source-430-459">炭俵載せたる馬車は</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-459-494"><seg source="#source-459-494">やや高き坂にかかりぬ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-494-526"><seg source="#source-494-526">そを馭する人は肝やみ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-526-564"><seg source="#source-526-564">くるしげにむちをば振ふ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-564-591"><seg source="#source-564-591">馬よりも人ぞ労れぬ</seg></p>
    </body>
